{
 "amendmentLines": [
  {
   "text": "To move the following Clause\u2014",
   "indentation": 0,
   "hangingIndentation": null,
   "isImage": false,
   "imageType": null
  },
  {
   "text": "<b>\u201cSingle sex facilities</b>",
   "indentation": 1,
   "hangingIndentation": null,
   "isImage": false,
   "imageType": null
  },
  {
   "text": "The Secretary of State is required to ensure that there are single sex\u2014",
   "indentation": 1,
   "hangingIndentation": "(1)",
   "isImage": false,
   "imageType": null
  },
  {
   "text": "changing rooms for NHS staff,",
   "indentation": 2,
   "hangingIndentation": "(a)",
   "isImage": false,
   "imageType": null
  },
  {
   "text": "toilets and washing facilities for NHS staff,",
   "indentation": 2,
   "hangingIndentation": "(b)",
   "isImage": false,
   "imageType": null
  },
  {
   "text": "wards for NHS patients, and",
   "indentation": 2,
   "hangingIndentation": "(c)",
   "isImage": false,
   "imageType": null
  },
  {
   "text": "toilets and washing facilities for NHS patients.",
   "indentation": 2,
   "hangingIndentation": "(d)",
   "isImage": false,
   "imageType": null
  },
  {
   "text": "The Secretary of State may make exemptions to the duty in subsection (1)(c) and (1)(d) where necessary for\u2014",
   "indentation": 1,
   "hangingIndentation": "(2)",
   "isImage": false,
   "imageType": null
  },
  {
   "text": "children,",
   "indentation": 2,
   "hangingIndentation": "(a)",
   "isImage": false,
   "imageType": null
  },
  {
   "text": "intensive care units,",
   "indentation": 2,
   "hangingIndentation": "(b)",
   "isImage": false,
   "imageType": null
  },
  {
   "text": "critical care, and",
   "indentation": 2,
   "hangingIndentation": "(c)",
   "isImage": false,
   "imageType": null
  },
  {
   "text": "specialist high observation areas such as resuscitation in Accident and Emergency and the initial recovery area in theatres.\u201d",
   "indentation": 2,
   "hangingIndentation": "(d)",
   "isImage": false,
   "imageType": null
  }
 ],
 "explanatoryTextPrefix": "Member's explanatory statement",
 "explanatoryText": "<p>This new clause creates a requirement for the Secretary of State to ensure certain single sex facilities are made available for NHS staff and patients. It provides exemptions in certain circumstances.</p>",
